        number: 2,
        title: "Eyeballing Superplasticizer and Water Ratios by Appearance",
        costImpact: "$950 (Segregation, Air Honeycombing & Retarded Cure)",
        description: "Polycarboxylate plasticizer operates at a threshold: adding just 10 milliliters too much causes mix segregation, while 10 milliliters too little leaves stiff, unworkable lumps.",
        solution: "Weigh all liquid plasticizers, polymers, and water on a digital gram scale accurate to 1 gram before blending with dry materials."
      },
